{"type":"Film","id":"IT2016_099","slug":"it2016-099-oggi-insieme-domani-anche-film-partecipato","title":{"native":"Oggi insieme domani anche: Film partecipato","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-05-19","year":2016},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Antonietta de Lillo","slug":"antonietta-de-lillo","name":"Antonietta de Lillo","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},{"id":"Marco S. Puccioni","slug":"marco-s-puccioni","name":"Marco S. Puccioni","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},{"id":"Fabiomassimo Lozzi","slug":"fabiomassimo-lozzi","name":"Fabiomassimo Lozzi","birthYear":1966,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},{"id":"Nunzia Esposito","slug":"nunzia-esposito","name":"Nunzia Esposito","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},{"id":"Bartolomeo Pampaloni","slug":"bartolomeo-pampaloni","name":"Bartolomeo Pampaloni","birthYear":1982,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5830242/mediaviewer/rm2862484480/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8J9enHoubEk"},"synopsis":{"native":"Un mosaico di sguardi, volti, storie raccolti da numerosi autori in giro per l’Italia. Un film partecipato, ideato e curato da Antonietta De Lillo, che, attraverso frammenti di materiali diversi (documentari, inchieste, animazione, immagini di attualità e di repertorio), compone un ritratto dell’amore oggi, a quarant’anni dal referendum sul divorzio e dai Comizi di Pasolini.","english":"What are we talking about, when we talk about love? For Antonietta De Lillo, Carver comes to mind and, after her 2011 film Il pranzo di Natale, she has made a new “participatory film” about the sentimental life of couples, singles and communities. The contributions (no longer than 3 minutes each) poured in for an investigation of love in times of crisis: videos, shorts, family movies, photos proposing collective and personal rites such as weddings, ceremonies, anniversaries, as well as separations and traumas."},"production":[{"country":"Italy","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Antonietta de Lillo","slug":"antonietta-de-lillo","name":"Antonietta de Lillo","birthYear":1960,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Bartolomeo Pampaloni","slug":"bartolomeo-pampaloni","name":"Bartolomeo Pampaloni","birthYear":1982,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Fabiomassimo Lozzi","slug":"fabiomassimo-lozzi","name":"Fabiomassimo Lozzi","birthYear":1966,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Marco S. Puccioni","slug":"marco-s-puccioni","name":"Marco S. Puccioni","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Nunzia Esposito","slug":"nunzia-esposito","name":"Nunzia Esposito","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Italy","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"}],"awards":[],"tags":["marriage"]}